---
description: Keep this public Kirby repository code-only and protect private content.
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a public, code-only Kirby CMS repository. Never modify, stage, commit, print or summarize private/live data from:

- `content/`
- `media/`
- `site/accounts/`
- `site/cache/`
- `site/sessions/`
- `site/logs/`
- `site/config/.license`
- `.env`
- `_deploy*/`

Only make code/config changes in safe project areas such as:

- `.cpanel.yml`, `.env.example`, `.gitattributes`, `.gitignore`, `.htaccess`
- `assets/css/`, `assets/js/`
- `site/blueprints/`, `site/config/config.php`, `site/docs/`
- `site/plugins/`, `site/snippets/`, `site/templates/`, `site/translations/`
- `tools/`

Before committing, run:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\tools\check-code-only.ps1
```

If a task requires content/media/account/secret changes, stop and ask the user for explicit approval.
